@startuml DFD Level 0 - Context Diagram (Gane & Sarson)

left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"

skinparam rectangle<<external>> {
  BackgroundColor #dbeafe
  BorderColor #2563eb
  BorderThickness 2
}

skinparam rectangle<<process>> {
  BackgroundColor #e8f4fd
  BorderColor #1e40af
  BorderThickness 3
  RoundCorner 25
}

title **Context Diagram - Lost & Found System**

rectangle "**End User**\n(Mobile App)" <<external>> as User
rectangle "**Admin**\n(Web Dashboard)" <<external>> as Admin
rectangle "**AI Services**\n(Python/FastAPI\n+ Deepgram STT)" <<external>> as AIServer

rectangle "**0**\nLost & Found\nSystem\n(Express + Supabase)" <<process>> as Process0

User -down-> Process0 : Login/Registration Details
User -down-> Process0 : Lost/Found Item Report\n(photo, description, category)
User -down-> Process0 : Search/Browse Query
User -down-> Process0 : Claim/Verification Proof
User -down-> Process0 : Message Content
User -down-> Process0 : AI Match Request
User -down-> Process0 : Audio Recording Data

Process0 -up-> User : Auth Token / Session
Process0 -up-> User : Item Confirmation / List
Process0 -up-> User : Match Results / Suggestions
Process0 -up-> User : Claim Status / Handover Schedule
Process0 -up-> User : Message Replies / Notifications
Process0 -up-> User : Timeline / Status Updates

Admin -down-> Process0 : Login Credentials
Admin -down-> Process0 : Dashboard / Analytics Request
Admin -down-> Process0 : Item Edit/Delete Commands
Admin -down-> Process0 : User/Role Management Commands
Admin -down-> Process0 : Category Management Data
Admin -down-> Process0 : Message Reply Content
Admin -down-> Process0 : Unclaimed Items Request
Admin -down-> Process0 : System Settings Data

Process0 -up-> Admin : Dashboard Stats / Charts
Process0 -up-> Admin : Activity Logs / Audit Trail
Process0 -up-> Admin : User & Item Lists
Process0 -up-> Admin : Item Update/Delete Confirmation
Process0 -up-> Admin : Unclaimed Item Reports
Process0 -up-> Admin : Settings Confirmation

AIServer -up-> Process0 : Text/Image Embeddings
AIServer -up-> Process0 : Match Scores & Rankings
AIServer -up-> Process0 : Auto-match Suggestions
AIServer -up-> Process0 : Transcription Text

Process0 -down-> AIServer : Item Descriptions & Images
Process0 -down-> AIServer : Embedding Poll Requests
Process0 -down-> AIServer : Audio Data (base64)

@enduml
